---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 5, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Disclosure"
	description="BaggageGear's disclosure covering affiliate relationships, sponsored content, advertising, product reviews, and editorial integrity."
	icon="💰"
>
	<p class="updated" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

	<p>
		At <strong>BaggageGear</strong>, we believe in <strong>transparency, honesty, and trust</strong>. As a website
		that provides product reviews, buying guides, and travel gear recommendations, it's important for our readers
		to understand how we operate, how we earn revenue, and how we maintain integrity in all our content. This
		disclosure explains our practices, affiliations, and policies to ensure you have complete clarity while using
		our website.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
	<p>
		Some of the products and services featured on BaggageGear are linked to <strong>affiliate programs</strong>.
		This means that we may earn a <strong>small commission</strong> if you make a purchase through these links,
		<strong>at no additional cost to you</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>We are a participant in various affiliate programs, including but not limited to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Amazon Associates Program</li>
		<li>Other travel and lifestyle retailer affiliate programs</li>
	</ul>
	<div class="note-box">
		<span class="note-icon">💵</span>
		<span>
			<strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> BaggageGear is a participant in
			the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means
			for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
		</span>
	</div>
	<p>
		These programs help support our website and allow us to continue producing high-quality content. Importantly,
		our participation in these programs <strong>does not influence our recommendations or reviews</strong>. Every
		product we feature is carefully researched and evaluated based on quality, usability, and value.
	</p>

	<h3>How we choose products</h3>
	<p>We select products for review and recommendation based on:</p>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>Quality:</strong> We prioritize products that are durable, reliable, and well-made.</li>
		<li><strong>User Experience:</strong> We consider ease of use, convenience, and design.</li>
		<li><strong>Value for Money:</strong> We focus on products that provide a good balance of quality and price.</li>
		<li><strong>Reader Relevance:</strong> Products are chosen based on relevance to our audience of travelers, parents, and everyday adventurers.</li>
	</ol>
	<p>
		Our goal is to ensure that every recommendation genuinely benefits our readers and enhances their travel or
		daily experience.
	</p>

	<h2>Sponsored content</h2>
	<p>
		Occasionally, BaggageGear may publish <strong>sponsored posts or reviews</strong> in partnership with brands
		and companies. These posts are clearly labeled as "Sponsored" or "Paid Partnership."
	</p>
	<p>Even in sponsored content, our <strong>editorial standards remain strict</strong>:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>We provide honest, unbiased opinions.</li>
		<li>We disclose any material connections to the brand.</li>
		<li>We aim to provide useful information, tips, and insights that benefit our readers.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Our commitment is always to <strong>maintain transparency</strong> while providing valuable and informative content.</p>

	<h2>Advertising</h2>
	<p>
		BaggageGear may display advertisements through various networks, including Google AdSense or other
		third-party providers. These ads may be targeted based on your interests, browsing behavior, or website
		activity.
	</p>
	<p>
		We do not have direct control over every ad you see, and the presence of ads
		<strong>does not influence our editorial content or product recommendations</strong>. Our editorial integrity
		is always independent of advertising partnerships. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for
		more on how cookies are used.
	</p>

	<h2>Product reviews and opinions</h2>
	<p>
		All reviews, guides, and recommendations on BaggageGear reflect our <strong>honest opinions</strong>. While we
		strive to test products personally, some products may be reviewed based on
		<strong>thorough research, customer feedback, and expert insights</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>Key points about our reviews:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Accuracy:</strong> We aim to provide accurate and up-to-date information.</li>
		<li><strong>Honesty:</strong> Positive and negative aspects of a product are disclosed.</li>
		<li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Affiliate relationships and sponsored content are clearly identified.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Your trust is our priority, and we never compromise our recommendations for profit or sponsorship.</p>

	<h2>Third-party links</h2>
	<p>
		BaggageGear may contain links to third-party websites, including online stores, travel services, and other
		resources. These links are provided for <strong>convenience and reference</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>Important notes:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>We do not control third-party websites and are not responsible for their content, products, or privacy practices.</li>
		<li>Any transactions or interactions with third-party sites are <strong>solely between you and the third-party provider</strong>.</li>
		<li>We recommend reviewing the terms, policies, and disclosures of any third-party site before making purchases or sharing personal information.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Using external links does not imply endorsement or guarantee of any products or services.</p>

	<h2>Earnings disclaimer</h2>
	<p>
		While BaggageGear may generate revenue through affiliate commissions, sponsorships, or advertising,
		<strong>earnings and income potential mentioned on the website are not guaranteed</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>Factors that affect revenue from products or services include:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Your location and access to retailers</li>
		<li>Product availability and pricing changes</li>
		<li>Your personal usage and choices</li>
	</ul>
	<p>All income or savings claims are based on estimates, research, and publicly available information. Individual results may vary.</p>

	<h2>Testimonials and reader feedback</h2>
	<p>
		BaggageGear may publish <strong>testimonials, comments, or feedback</strong> from readers, customers, or
		partners. While we aim to present authentic experiences,
		<strong>results and opinions shared by others do not guarantee the same outcome for you</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>
		We encourage readers to use our guides and recommendations as <strong>informative resources</strong>, while
		making independent decisions based on their unique needs and circumstances.
	</p>

	<h2>Editorial integrity</h2>
	<p>
		Our editorial team at BaggageGear maintains <strong>strict independence from brands and advertisers</strong>.
		Editorial decisions are based solely on:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Product performance and usability</li>
		<li>Relevance to our audience</li>
		<li>Trustworthiness of sources and research</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		We never allow sponsorships, affiliate relationships, or advertising to influence the accuracy, tone, or
		integrity of our content.
	</p>

	<h2>Privacy and personal data</h2>
	<p>
		BaggageGear respects your <strong>privacy and personal information</strong>. We may collect non-personal
		information such as website usage data, browser type, and pages visited to improve our services and provide a
		better user experience.
	</p>
	<p>For personal information collected through forms, subscriptions, or contact pages:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>We will only use your information for communication and service purposes.</li>
		<li>We do not sell or share your personal data with unauthorized third parties.</li>
		<li>We adhere to privacy best practices to keep your information secure.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>For more details, please refer to our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

	<h2>Compliance with regulations</h2>
	<p>BaggageGear complies with applicable laws and guidelines, including:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>FTC Guidelines</strong> for affiliate disclosure and sponsored content</li>
		<li><strong>Advertising standards</strong> for online promotions</li>
		<li><strong>Consumer protection laws</strong> for accurate product representation</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		We are committed to <strong>transparency and compliance</strong>, ensuring that our readers have all the
		information needed to make informed decisions.
	</p>

	<h2>Commitment to honesty</h2>
	<p>
		At the heart of BaggageGear is our commitment to <strong>honest and trustworthy communication</strong>. We
		aim to:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Clearly identify affiliate links and sponsored content</li>
		<li>Provide unbiased reviews and practical advice</li>
		<li>Maintain transparency in all aspects of our website</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Your confidence in our recommendations is essential, and we work diligently to uphold this trust every day.</p>

	<h2>Updates to our disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		BaggageGear reserves the right to <strong>update or modify this disclosure</strong> at any time to reflect
		changes in affiliate relationships, advertising partnerships, or website policies.
	</p>
	<p>
		We encourage readers to <strong>check this page periodically</strong> to stay informed about how we operate
		and maintain transparency. Questions? Visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
	</p>
</StaticPage>
